   650 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   651 				; Image_Open - OPEN FileNamePtr for read on the first free IOCB (the same
   652 				; sequence LoadData uses, but the file stays open across several block reads).
   653 				;  Out: C=0 and Load_IOCB = IOCB offset, or C=1 (no IOCB / OPEN failed - the
   654 				;       IOCB is closed again so it doesn't leak).
   655 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
