   218 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   219 				; Build_Image_List - rebuild the selector list in IMAGE_BANK through the $2000
   220 				; window, grouped:  ".."  (only below the drive root)  |  sub-directories  |
   221 				; *.V1K files.  Rescan_Images sorts the two real groups A-Z afterwards.
   222 				; Sets ImageCount, Dir_Count and FileStart (index of the first *.V1K row).
   223 				;   - directory pass: OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.*" long DIR format (AUX2 = $80) and keep
   224 				;     only lines carrying SDX's "<DIR>" size-column tag (Line_Has_Dir_Tag).
   225 				;   - file pass:      OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.V1K" short format (AUX2 = $00) as before.
   226 				; One 8-byte write cursor (Name_Ptr) and one ImageNames_End guard span both.
   227 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
