   846 				; Selector_DrawCount - row 0's right-hand image counter for the current
   847 				; Sel_Index: "nnn of NNN" on a *.V1K row, else "NNN images" (" image " for
   848 				; one) - always 10 chars at UI_COUNT_COL, numbers space-padded to 3.  NNN =
   849 				; ImageCount - FileStart (the *.V1K group only).  Builds it in Txt_Line.
   850 				; Clobbers A/X/Y, Reg1, Reg2, Reg7, Txt_Ptr.
   851 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
