   919 				; Selector_DrawStatus - repaint row 20 for the current Sel_Index, and row 0's
   920 				; image counter (Selector_DrawCount).  Blank for a directory / ".." row or an
   921 				; empty list; "Nfo: <name>" for a *.V1K row whose slot was filled from
   922 				; IMAGES.LST.  Pure VRAM read - no file I/O.
