  1031 				; Nfo_Name_LoadManifest - open "D[n]:PATH IMAGES.LST", and for every record
  1032 				; (8-byte key + description + $9B) store it into the matching *.V1K
  1033 				; row's slot.  Called from Rescan_Images right after Nfo_Name_ClearCache.
