  1554 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1555 				; Sel_Nav_Apply - A = new Sel_Index (already range-checked by the caller).
  1556 				; Common tail for the four nav keys: scrolls (full repaint) if the move
  1557 				; crosses the visible window, else just re-colours the old and new cells;
  1558 				; always repaints the status line, then returns to the key loop.
  1559 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
