  1583 				; that index inside the visible UI_VISROWS x UI_COLS window, scrolling by
  1584 				; whole grid rows from the CURRENT Sel_Top.  Read-only - caller compares
  1585 				; against Sel_Top and stores it.  Clobbers X, Reg1.
